cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "polyring: Groth16-in-Groth16 recursion for gnark"
abstract: >-
  polyring checks a BN254 or BLS12-381 Groth16 pairing inside a BN254
  Groth16 circuit, by evaluating the pairing over a polynomial ring with
  deferred product checks. It makes the outer proof cheaper to prove at the
  price of a bigger on-chain verifier.
type: software
authors:
